@startuml
title RPC Communication Flow

participant "Client Application" as Client
participant "Host Adapter" as RPC
participant "Worker Dispatch" as Dispatch
participant "Worker Core (Bare)" as Server

Client -> RPC : loadModel({ modelSrc, ... })
RPC -> Dispatch : JSON request
Dispatch -> Server : route loadModel

note over Server : Download model (if needed)
Server --> Dispatch : progress: { downloaded, total }
Dispatch --> RPC : progress frame
RPC --> Client : progress: { downloaded, total }

note over Server : Plugin.createModel -> load native addon
Server -> Dispatch : response: { modelId }
Dispatch -> RPC : response frame
RPC -> Client : response: { modelId }

Client -> RPC : completion({ modelId, history })
RPC -> Dispatch : JSON request
Dispatch -> Server : route completionStream

note over Server : Plugin handler (streaming)
loop Token streaming
    Server --> Dispatch : stream: token chunk
    Dispatch --> RPC : stream frame
    RPC --> Client : stream: token chunk
end

Server -> Dispatch : final: { stats }
Dispatch -> RPC : final frame
RPC -> Client : final: { stats }

note over RPC
  Node/Bun/Electron: Unix socket or Windows named pipe
  Expo: BareKit Worklet IPC
  Python: loopback TCP
  Bare direct: in-process adapter
end note

@enduml
